      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This is why you get \"BUG: sleeping function called from invalid context\" when you accidentally call `mutex_lock()` from an interrupt handler.",
      "source_hash": 15473467598852051435,
      "context_hash": 6856704331750817932,
      "translation": "인터럽트 핸들러에서 실수로 `mutex_lock()`을 호출하면 \"BUG: sleeping function called from invalid context\"가 발생하는 이유가 바로 이것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt handler": "인터럽트 핸들러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:12:51.433253Z",
      "issues": []
    },
